    {
      "id": 17914248,
      "commentKey": "v2ex-17914248",
      "parentId": 1230534,
      "author": "Fish1024",
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-28T15:42:22.000Z",
      "level": 1,
      "hnUrl": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230534#reply17914248",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230534#reply17914248",
      "floor": 14,
      "textRawHtml": "有台式 Mac 没？比如 Mac mini 、iMac 等。有的话直接把照片图库放到外置硬盘上，Photos 设置为 Download Originals to this Mac 。这样 iCloud 有一份，本地外置硬盘中有一份。<br />外置硬盘速率记得 usb4 或者雷电 3 以上哦。",
